# Production build-time environment defaults for Create React App (react-scripts).
#
# NOTE:
# - CRA uses GENERATE_SOURCEMAP (not REACT_APP_ENABLE_SOURCE_MAPS) to control sourcemap generation.
# - Disabling sourcemaps typically speeds up builds and reduces memory usage in CI/container deploys.
# - This does not change application runtime behavior; it only affects build artifacts.

GENERATE_SOURCEMAP=false
`````

Explanation: Document the build-speed fix so future changes don’t accidentally reintroduce slow builds.
