### `npm run build`

Builds the app for production to the `build` folder.\
It correctly bundles React in production mode and optimizes the build for the best performance.

#### Build performance note (CI/deploy)

This project includes a `.env.production` that sets:

- `GENERATE_SOURCEMAP=false`

This is a Create React App (react-scripts) build-time flag that disables sourcemap generation to keep CI/container builds fast and avoid "stuck" builds in constrained environments.
